ivariate normal distribution.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/dschrempf/pava&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;pava&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;11 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;Pool adjacent violators aglorithm&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/dschrempf/elynx&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;elynx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;9 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;Analyze, modify and simulate molecular sequence data and phylogenetic trees in a reproducible way.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dschrempf/dschrempf/main/github-metrics.svg?sanitize=true&quot; alt=&quot;Metrics&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
